{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And he made for his father a mourning of seven days.</b> There the chieftains of Esav, the princes of Yishmael, and the sons of Ketura came to pay him honor, and there they made a fresh mourning, for so is the way: when another of the deceased's relatives arrives, they weep anew as at the beginning."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 50, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:09:22.464125049Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}